  },
  {
    "speaker": "ダンス講師",
    "text": "にちかさんと一緒にレッスン受けてみて、どうだった？\r\n楽しかった？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "子ども１",
    "text": "うん！\r\nすごく、楽しかったし、勉強になりました！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "子ども１",
    "text": "ほんとは美琴さんにも……\r\n会って、みたかったけど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1024004030280,
    "speaker": "にちか",
    "text": "あははー\r\nいやー……そこはほんと、申し訳ないですー",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "nichika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/102400403/1024004030280"
  },
  {
    "id": 1024004030290,
    "speaker": "にちか",
    "text": "ダンスはやっぱり……\r\n美琴さんの方が、すごいですもんねー",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "nichika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102400403/1024004030290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "子ども１",
    "text": "────うーん……そうかもしれないけど、\r\nわたし、にちかちゃんのダンスもすきです！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1024004030300,
    "speaker": "にちか",
    "text": "えー、なんでですー？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "nichika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
